    'Jetpack Stats: records referral and navigation data for analytics.' => 'Jetpack Stats: beleži podatke o napotitvah in navigaciji za analitiko.',
    'Kansleri Cookie Consent is now active. Next steps: %1$s to discover cookies and %2$s to review banner and consent settings.' => 'Kansleri Cookie Consent je zdaj aktiven. Naslednja koraka: %1$s, da jih odkrijete, in %2$s pasice in privolitve.',
